---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="what makes this so hard" description="the question that has killed more of my startup ideas than competitors ever did.">
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <div class="font-mono text-xs text-faint mb-4">
      <a href="/writing" class="text-accent hover:underline">writing</a> <span class="text-faint">/</span> what-makes-this-so-hard
    </div>

    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-normal animate-fade-up">what makes this so hard</h1>

    <div class="essay mt-10 animate-fade-up delay-1">
      <p>whenever i think “why hasn’t anyone built this yet?” i force myself to ask the opposite question.</p>
      <p>“what makes this so hard that nobody has pulled it off already?”</p>
      <hr class="my-12 border-border" />
      <p>that single question has killed more startup ideas than competitors ever did.</p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-spice">learned that heuristic from yudkowsky years ago.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-6 border-t border-border">
      <a href="/writing" class="text-accent hover:underline">← back to writing</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .essay p {
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
</style>
